2 CONC e North (Dik-pala), and a protector of the world (Lokapala). His many epithets extol him as the overlord of numerous semi-divine species and the owner of the treasures of the world. Kubera is often depicted as a fat man, adorned w
2 CONC ith jewels and carrying a money-pot or money-bag, and a club.
