2 CONC  become a beautiful woman and be married to a great valorous man. After twelve years, Madhura becomes a beautiful maiden again and cries out loudly from the well. Mayasura and Hema, who are performing penance nearby, answer her ca
2 CONC ll and adopt her as their daughter. They bring her up as Mandodari.[2] Marriage and later life
