2 CONC brothers’!joint!wife!Drapaudi.!Then!Bhima!and!Hidimbi!had!a!child,!whom!they!called!Ghatotkacha.!Ghatotkacha!was!a!giant!and!he!swore!to!come!to!the!aid!of!his!father!whenever!necessary!
