1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Shalya
2 CONT
2 CONT IN the epic Mahabharata, King Shalya (Sanskrit: शल्‍य) was the brother of Madri (mother of Nakula and Sahadeva), as well as the ruler of the kingdom of Madra (Madra-desa). Shalya, being a skilled archer,a powerful mace fighter and
2 CONC  formidable warrior, was tricked by Duryodana to fight the war on the side of the Kauravas. Shalya had a strange ability which made him invincible in battle. The more aggression his enemies showed while fighting against him, Shaly
2 CONC a would become even more powerful thus making him victorious. Only Yudhishthira could kill the powerful warrior because the eldest Pandava was not a man of aggression. Thus instead of becoming powerful, Shalya was severely weakene
2 CONC d and Yudhishthira could slay him with difficulty and the help of his four brothers, Satyaki, and Dhristidumana. •	 Becoming Pandu's brother-in-law[ On his way to Hastinapur, King Pandu encountered the army of Shalya, King of Madr
2 CONC a. Very soon, Pandu and Shalya became friends and Shalya gave his only sister, Madri to Pandu, as a gift of their friendship. Looking at her beauty, Pandu accepted the lady willingly and took her to Hastinapur. Falling prey to Dur
2 CONC yodhana's trick[ After the Pandavas' exile, Shalya intended to visit them. When he heard of the impending Kurukshetra War, he marched forth with his army to join his nephews. On the way, Shalya was tricked byDuryodhana, who arrang
2 CONC ed a huge feast for Shalya and his men. When Shalya was impressed by the hospitality of his host who he mistakenly thought to be Yudhisthira, he offered to be at his host's service. Unable to turn down Duryodhana's request to join
2 CONC  the Kauravas, Shalya met Yudhisthira and apologized for his mistake. Yudhishtira, knowing that Shalya was a great charioteer and forecasting that Shalya would someday be asked to be the charioteer of Karna, extracted a vow from S
2 CONC halya to the effect that Shalya will demoralise Karna and dampen his spirits. Shalya assured the Pandavas that he would do everything possible to demoralise Karna and dampen his spirits.[1] During the Kurukshetra War[ War with Utt
2 CONC ar Kumara[edit source |
2 CONT
2 CONT Shalya kills Uttar Having entered the war reluctantly, Shalya confronted many great warriors and killed them. Shalya killedAbhimanyu’s brother-in-law, Uttar Kumara on the first day of the war. Uttar Kumara was the son of King Virā
2 CONC ta, who with Arjuna’s help, had defeated the Kaurava army that had invaded the Virāta kingdom. Uttar Kumara then had beenArjuna’s charioteer. Shalya killed the boy with his spear, displaying fantastic skill.[2] Later Abhimanyu too
2 CONC k revenge by killing Shalya’s brother and son and disabling Shalya himself so badly that the great warrior could not even move in Dronacharya’s circular formation (Chakravyuha). Last three days of the war[ 
2 CONT
2 CONT This painting shows a warrior (at left) holding the spear, and is likely the moment before Shalya's death On the 16th and 17th days of the war, Shalya served as Karna's charioteer during the latter's battle with Arjuna, while cont
2 CONC inuously praising the Pandava prince and citing Karna's shortcomings. After Karna's death, Shalya took over as the commander of the Kaurava forces. Shalya was commander-in-chief on the last day of the war and near the end of the b
2 CONC attle he was killed by King Yudhishtira with a spear.[3] Ashwathama took over after his death, but the Kauravas were largely leaderless and broke ranks fleeing from the slaughter.
2 CONT
2 CONT ON THE 18th DAY OF THE BATTLE YUDHISTHIRA KILLED SHALYA.
2 CONT
2 CONT AFTER KARNA'S DEATH DURYODHANA CHOSE, SHALYA  AND GAVE HIM THE SUPREME COMMAND FROM THEN ON. SHALYA WAS MIGHTY OF  LIMB AND AS BRAVE AS ANY OF THE WARRIERS WHO HAD BEEN KILLED. THE ARMY WAS ARRAYED UNDER HIS LEADERSHIP AND THE BAT
2 CONC TLE RAGED FIERCELY. THE BATTLE WAS EQUAL FOR A LONG WHILE, WHEN YUDHISTHIRA HURLED AT SHALYA, HIS SPEAR WHICH WENT STRAIGHT AND STRUCT HIM. LIKE THE GREAT FLAGSTAFF AT THE END OF FUNCTION, SHALYA'S BODY LAY LIFELESS ON THE FIELD, 
2 CONC CRIMSON WITH BLOOD.
