2 CONT  Mansor, Suffian; Sundara Raja, Sivachandralingam; Mohd Noor, Arbaiyah; Mohd Rus, Ahmad Kamal Ariffin (2014). Sejarah dan Kesarjanaan. University of Malaya Press. p. 34. ISBN 978-967-0380-40-7.
2 CONT  Miksic, John N.; Goh, Geok Yian (2016). Ancient South East Asia. Taylor & Francis. ISBN 9781317279037.
