2 CONC yrik dan maghrib; melainkan Allah subha nahu wa taala juga yang mengetahuinya Tetapi akan Raja Sulan itu raja besar sekali, segala raja-raja Hindi dan Sindi, sekalian dalam tangannya, dan segala raja-raja yang di bawah angin ini s
2 CONC ekaliannya takluk kepada baginda itu.::."  -or- from Malay Annals - ".::. Raja Narsi Barderas married the daughter of Raja Salan, the raja of Amdan Nayara, who, it is asserted by some, was the grandson of Raja Nashirwan Adel, the 
2 CONC son of Raja Kobad Shah Shahriar, who was raja of the east and west. This Raja Sulan was the mightiest prince of the lands of Hind and Sind, and of all the rajas under the wind (i. e. towards the west, the wind being supposed to ri
2 CONC se with the sun).::."
