2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT aka DharmaWira IndraWarman. From Leyden's "Malay Annals" http://books.google.com/books?id=J9JAAAAAYAAJ Raja Suran Padshah was ruler of Amdan Nagara (or Amdan Nayara); later he invaded Gangga Nagara; and then invaded Glang Kiu. Raj
2 CONC a Suran is from the city of Bijnagar in the land of Kling (Kalinga, now Orissa) [see http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gangga_Negara and http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kota_Gelanggi ]. Inscriptions from K.Gellangi tell it was raided by h
2 CONC ttp://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rajendra_Chola_I in 1025. 
2 CONT --------------------
