2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Sunan Parung did not reign for long, only for a few years. The most important development during his reign was that he established Government Representatives known as "Dalem" - placed in Kulur, Sindangkasih, Jerokaso Maja.
2 CONT
2 CONT He only had one daughter, named Ratu Sunyalarang or Ratu Parung (Queen Sunyalarang, Queen of Parung). 
