2 CONT Note on profile of Joyce:
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the second Talaga King to convert to Islam. Relations between Talaga, Cirebon and Pajajaran were good. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Prabu Pucuk Unum's father, Raden Munding Sari Ageng is the son of Prabu Siliwangi. Marriage with Ratu Sunyalarang is a family marriage of the 4th degree. 
2 CONT
2 CONT From the marriage with Ratu Sunyalarang (Queen Parung), 6 children were born. Most notable was Prabu Haurkuning. Others were Sunan Wanaperih, Dalem Lumaju Agung, Dalem Panuntun, Dalem Panaekan. 
2 CONT
2 CONT At the end of the 15th century, Majalengka's people were mostly Moslems. Before passing away, Prabu Pucuk Umum gave his sons different territories to reign:
2 CONT
2 CONT Sunan Wanaperih reigned of Walangsuji
2 CONT
2 CONT Dalem Lumaju Agung in the Maja territory
2 CONT
2 CONT Dalem Panuntun in Majalengka 
2 CONT
2 CONT While his eldest son, Prabu Haurkuning reigned in Talaga that is known also as Ciamis. Many of his descendants later would become Regents.
2 CONT
2 CONT Dalem Panaekan, who was from Walangsuji moved from place to place, from Riung Gunung, Sukamenek, Nunuk Cibodas and Kulur, 
2 CONT
2 CONT Pucuk Unum's grave is near Situ Sangiang Talaga.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://222.124.159.131/cms-mjlk-0.5.0-rc3/index.php?mod=public&act=content&do=0&ct=2&cnt=61&cms_majalengka_0_6_0=bf876afdc7645855957762072273fd08 
