2 CONT ''''''Terminology Ngabehi / Ngabei'''''':
2 CONT
2 CONT In Javanese aristocratic tradition, "Ngabehi" / 'Ngabei'(often preceded by the title "Raden") is a title of nobility, a respected position given to elders or important individuals within the Javanese palace or aristocratic society
2 CONC , especially in Surakarta Hadiningrat. 
2 CONT
2 CONT It signifies someone of high status, sometimes considered spiritual nobility, and serves as a designation for those who serve the Javanese palace with devotion and adherence to its rules. 
